[00:07.00]The city hums a quiet tune tonight
[00:10.50]Every window glowing pink and blue
[00:14.00]I trace the border of the falling light
[00:17.50]And every color leads me back to you
[00:21.00]
[00:29.00]Turn it up, the frame begins to spin
[00:32.50]Turn it up, let the rhythm in
[00:36.00]Round and round the edges of the screen
[00:39.50]Brighter than anything I've ever seen
[00:43.00]
[00:52.00]Hold the line, the beat is holding me
[00:55.50]Every pulse a little louder than before
[00:59.00]A neon horizon over the sea
[01:02.50]Shining all the way to the door
[01:06.00]
[01:16.00]Turn it up, the frame begins to spin
[01:19.50]Turn it up, let the rhythm in
